  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Opt 600 REPEALED\n\nAPPENDIX A - Statutes Implemented\n\nAPPENDIX B - Incorporation By Reference Information\n\nOpt 504.07 | National Practice Guideline For the Use of Medications in the Treatment of Addiction Involving Opioid Use,” adopted on June 1, 2015 | The American Society of Addiction Medicine’s 4601 North Park Avenue, Upper Arcade Suite 101 Chevy Chase, MD 20815-4520 (301) 656-3920 or (301) 656-3815 No cost to download from: https://mharslc.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/asam-national-practice-guideline.pdf",
